    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 0
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Oh… Oh no… It was her! I’m sure of it. It even looked similar. This place was supposed to be abandoned and now I’m seeing her? Why?! I can’t shake the feeling that she keeps calling me, that she’s still in the shadows. What should I do?!
